; peoplesweb.org apex zone (GPW).  Deployed to
; /var/lib/knot/zones/peoplesweb.org.zone on vps3492120.
; TTL discipline per GPW Section 6 and the design notes' DNS mechanics:
; delegations and infrastructure records carry long expiries (86400 s);
; address records (web-name -> mirroring server) carry minutes (300 s),
; so repoints take effect fast.  The apex A record is the address record
; of the federation's own web presence, hence 300 s.
$ORIGIN peoplesweb.org.
$TTL 86400
@       SOA     ns1.peoplesweb.org. hostmaster.peoplesweb.org. (
                2026071201      ; serial (YYYYMMDDnn)
                3600            ; refresh
                900             ; retry
                1209600         ; expire (14 days)
                300             ; negative-answer TTL
                )
@       NS      ns1.peoplesweb.org.
@       NS      ns2.peoplesweb.org.
@       300     A       162.35.180.99
ns1             A       162.35.180.99
ns2             A       162.35.180.99
